    path: 'extensions/snap-to-grid/index.md',
    title: 'Rectangular 2D grid',
    category: 'extensions',
    summary:
      'Rectangular 2D grid extension reference: the Snap objects to a virtual grid action with its parameters and internal type.',
    body:
      'Snaps objects on a *virtual 2D grid* (this is not the grid used in the editor). Useful for level editors and building systems.\n\n## Actions\n\n**Snap objects to a virtual grid**\n\n- Parameter 1 (Object): Objects to snap to the virtual grid\n- Parameter 2 (Number): Width of a cell of the virtual grid (in pixels)\n- Parameter 3 (Number): Height of a cell of the virtual grid (in pixels)\n- Parameter 4 (Number): Offset on the X axis of the virtual grid (in pixels)\n- Parameter 5 (Number): Offset on the Y axis of the virtual grid (in pixels)\n\nInternal type: `SnapToGrid::SnapObjectToVirtualGrid`. Parameters 0, 6 are internal parameters handled by GDevelop.',
    tags: ['extensions', 'snap-to-grid'],
